{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_070820","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“Mammal”就是“哺乳类”的意思。成为<R=哺乳类,MAMMAL>之后发展起来的大脑，负责高级精神活动。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=哺乳类,MAMMAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"比如？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"智能、判断……还有爱。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"原来如此，确实是最高级的功能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"从位置上说，就是位于<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>脑外侧的部分，大脑皮层也包括在内。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Strangelove把自己的Pod命名为“Mammal”，大概也体现了她的决心吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"她想要的不是单纯的高性能AI，而是让精神寄宿其中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""}]}